                            {
                                "example_id": "9369a6c5-caa3-4218-9a20-593979459095",
                                "sense_id": "ef4e48e0-6b5a-3f62-8bdf-afdadaee7211",
                                "text": "[…] employing the word \"dominant\" to refer to those persons who appear more European in type, and \"recessive\" to the more negroidal type […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4212272-a100-43bf-8cc8-ad5583199ed6",
                                "sense_id": "ef4e48e0-6b5a-3f62-8bdf-afdadaee7211",
                                "text": "And what pisses me off is the arrogance of people whose whole thing is just a blatant imitation of the negroidal tradition. Blatant. And even the major exponents of this type of music have said that themselves."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f02e425-badd-4309-a2ee-8dd46610b673",
                                "sense_id": "ef4e48e0-6b5a-3f62-8bdf-afdadaee7211",
                                "text": "Raising the specter of miscegenation, this pro-segregationist and anti-rock tract recoiled over \"teenage daughters ... squealing and drooling over Negroidal crooners.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
